<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Locate Object</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 19), Druid (guild level 35)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast locate object &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>Gives you a sense of where an object is: you see it, and where it lies, the 
room it is in, or the one who carries it. It looks in your own area first, 
and then in the whole world, and it finds one such object, the first it 
comes to.
</p><p>If the spell fails badly, the one who has the object realizes that you tried 
to locate it. You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Locate Person</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Find Path</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>